research/audit/wave7-A3.md-59-
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-60-1. `thm-completeness-equivalences` title repair — **APPROVE**. The Statement's
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-61-   five clauses are LUB, ARCH+NIP, BW, ARCH+CC, and MCT; MCT already implies
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-62-   ARCH on disk. Attaching ARCH to MCT in the title is false.
research/audit/wave7-A3.md:63:2. `fs-nested-intervals-implies-lub` weaker-antecedent sentence — **APPROVE**.
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-64-   A weaker antecedent makes an implication stronger because it applies to
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-65-   more structures; the replacement states that direction correctly.
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-66-3. `ex-rational-function-field-order` uniqueness sentence — **APPROVE**. The
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-67-   displayed positive-infinity cone is representative-independent and
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-68-   multiplicative, but composing it with the automorphism `t |-> -t` gives the
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-69-   negative-infinity order, which disagrees on the sign of `t`. The proposed
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-70-   “one ... choice” replacement is exact. Apply the provenance URL override
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-71-   above at the same time.
--
