research/audit/wave7-A3.md-86-   strict to non-strict order compatibility, exactly the earlier target's
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-87-   clause.
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-88-8. Removal of the unrestricted-NIP claims and the dependency on
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-89-   `cex-laurent-nested-intervals-empty` from
research/audit/wave7-A3.md:90:   `def-completeness-properties`, `fs-nested-intervals-implies-lub`,
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-91-   `ex-cauchy-complete-not-complete-field`, and the A-page prose — **DECLINE —
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-92-   OWNER**. The on-disk Laurent-series calculation supports the construction,
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-93-   but its Statement is already `ai-generated` and cannot be load-bearing.
